<!-- The status-bar notification glyph: a paw, white on transparent.

     Android renders a small icon from its ALPHA CHANNEL only, so any colour
     here is discarded and anything opaque becomes white. That is why this is
     a separate drawable rather than the launcher icon: the launcher icon is a
     full-colour square, and as a small icon it draws as a white block.
     Referenced by the default_notification_icon meta-data in
     AndroidManifest.xml. -->
